# DESK18 -- launch through a DOCUMENT ASSOCIATION: double-click C:\HELLO.TXT in
# the right-hand C:\ window, which is already the top one (probe run), so a
# plain double-click suffices.
#
# The seeded `#G` line installs C:\SUB\CURDIR.NCP as the handler for `*.TXT`;
# its INF_AT_APPDIR bit is what `do_aopen`'s `is_installed` arm reads
# (`desksupp.c:896-902`). The application's directory (C:\SUB\) and the top
# window's (C:\) differ here, so the two settings of that bit give two
# different answers.
#
# Click point (435, 260) = HELLO.TXT's icon-glyph centre from the probe dump
# (`[desk18]   obj 28 'HELLO.TXT' box (397,244) 76x40 -> click (435,260)`).
100 parkbr
300 move 600 460
1000 arm
1200 mark A_IDLE
1500 move 435 260
1800 down
1803 up
1808 down
1811 up
